<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Access Denied - Restricted Page</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Open+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #e8e8e8;
            font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .container {
            position: static;
            /* width: 100%; */
            /* max-width: 1000px; */
            min-height: 500px;
            /* background: #f0f0f0; */
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 40px 60px 40px 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            flex-direction: row-reverse;
        }

        /* Diagonal caution tape - top right */
        .tape-top {
            position: absolute;
            top: -10px;
            right: -60px;
            width: 120%;
            height: 45px;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(
                -45deg,
                #cc0000,
                #cc0000 20px,
                #fff 20px,
                #fff 40px
            );
            transform: rotate(-5deg);
            transform-origin: top right;
            opacity: 0.85;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        /* Diagonal caution tape - bottom left */
        .tape-bottom {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: -60px;
            width: 120%;
            height: 45px;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(
                -45deg,
                #cc0000,
                #cc0000 20px,
                #fff 20px,
                #fff 40px
            );
            transform: rotate(-5deg);
            transform-origin: bottom left;
            opacity: 0.85;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .mascot {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            max-width: 1900px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: self-end;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .mascot img {
            width: 135%;
            max-width: 400px;
            height: auto;
            filter: drop-shadow(4px 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.2));
            animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
        }

        .content {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: center;
            padding-left: 20px;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .content h1 {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 5rem;
            color: #cc0000;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        .content h2 {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            color: #222;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .content p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #444;
            line-height: 1.7;
            max-width: 480px;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #cc0000;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .redirect-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 18px;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            padding: 12px 32px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background 0.25s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        .redirect-link:hover {
            background: #1d4ed8;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .redirect-link:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container {
                flex-direction: column;
                padding: 60px 30px 60px;
                text-align: center;
            }
            .mascot { width: 200px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
            .content h1 { font-size: 3rem; }
            .content h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
            .content { padding-left: 0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="tape-top"></div>
        <div class="tape-bottom"></div>

        <div class="mascot">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Tom Officer Mascot">
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <h1>ACCESS DENIED!</h1>
            <h2>RESTRICTED PAGE</h2>
            <p>Sorry, you are not authorized to view this page. This area is restricted to authorized personnel only. Please contact the IT &amp; Services Department if you need access.</p>
            <span class="badge">Information Technology &amp; Services Department</span><br>
            <a href="https://services.tomsworld.com.ph/vms/" class="redirect-link">Go to Kiosk V-Pass - Tom's World &amp; Pan-Asia</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>